Error: Jet.ImplOnBuiltinType: `impl F32.Decode` needs a user-defined type
  --> Tests/UI/decode_impl_on_builtin_is_core_encodings.jet:3:6
    |
  3 | impl F32.Decode {
    |      ^^^
 Why: `F32` is built in, and an `impl` only extends a struct, enum, or distinct type declared by your program
 Fix: Implement `Decode` on a struct or distinct type of your own, or wrap `F32` in one
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ImplOnBuiltinType
